+// Forty times the throughput per vertex, in the same app and the same frame -
+// which is also why a Metal port is not the gate here. Instancing 623000
+// eight-vertex instances was 88% of the toolpath frame; the shader was 12%,
+// which is why four rounds of shader work moved nothing.
